# Companion Advancement Options
# `Intelligent	TYPE:CompanionAdvancement	DESC:Companion gains a permanent +1 bonus to a Companion Experience.	SOURCEPAGE:p.22
# `Light in the Dark	TYPE:CompanionAdvancement	DESC:Use as an additional Hope slot your character can mark.	SOURCEPAGE:p.22
# `Creature Comfort	TYPE:CompanionAdvancement	DESC:Once per rest during quiet moments, gain a Hope or both clear a Stress.	SOURCEPAGE:p.22
# `Armored Companion	TYPE:CompanionAdvancement	DESC:Mark one of your Armor Slots instead of marking a companion's Stress when they take damage.	SOURCEPAGE:p.22
# `Vicious Companion	TYPE:CompanionAdvancement	DESC:Increase companion's damage die or range by one step.	SOURCEPAGE:p.22
# `Resilient Companion	TYPE:CompanionAdvancement	DESC:Companion gains an additional Stress slot.	SOURCEPAGE:p.22
# `Aware Companion	TYPE:CompanionAdvancement	DESC:Companion gains a permanent +2 bonus to Evasion.	SOURCEPAGE:p.22
